          "groundingSupports": [
            {
              "segment": {
                "endIndex": 328,
                "text": "Melbourne’s luxury real estate market—concentrated across the inner-east (Toorak, South Yarra, Armadale, Malvern), the leafy east (Hawthorn, Kew, Canterbury), the Bayside coastline (Brighton), and the Mornington Peninsula (Portsea, Sorrento, Flinders)—is dominated by a small, tightly connected cohort of prestige agencies"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                0,
                1,
                2
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 463,
                "endIndex": 543,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Toorak, South Yarra, Bayside, Flinders, Portsea, Sorrento"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 547,
                "endIndex": 623,
                "text": "**Reputation:** The traditional gold standard of Melbourne prestige property"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 667,
                "endIndex": 770,
                "text": "Kay & Burton has handled many of Melbourne’s grandest estates and architectural landmarks for decades"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 776,
                "endIndex": 944,
                "text": "They excel at bespoke, editorial-grade marketing campaigns and have established channels into overseas capital (notably across Singapore, Hong Kong, and mainland China)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 950,
                "endIndex": 1076,
                "text": "They have a seamless pipeline connecting Melbourne’s blue-chip enclaves with luxury second homes on the Mornington Peninsula"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                3,
                4
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1128,
                "endIndex": 1217,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Stonnington (Toorak, Armadale), Boroondara, and Bayside (Brighton)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                5,
                6,
                0
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1221,
                "endIndex": 1280,
                "text": "**Reputation:** The high-volume, record-breaking powerhouse"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                5,
                6
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1324,
                "endIndex": 1469,
                "text": "Marshall White is one of the most prolific operators in the high-end space, driven by marquee directors like Marcus Chiminello and John Bongiorno"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                6
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1475,
                "endIndex": 1628,
                "text": "They frequently set and break Melbourne residential benchmarks, including transacting the historic ~$80 million estate at 29–31 St Georges Road, Toorak"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                6
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1634,
                "endIndex": 1774,
                "text": "Their database and cross-office buyer matching across Melbourne’s affluent eastern and southern suburbs are among the deepest in Australia"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                5,
                6
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1848,
                "endIndex": 1942,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Super-prime Toorak, inner-east estates, and luxury lifestyle properties"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                7,
                8,
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 1946,
                "endIndex": 2048,
                "text": "**Reputation:** Ultra-prime specialists catering to the top tier of High-Net-Worth Individuals (HNWIs)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                10,
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2092,
                "endIndex": 2210,
                "text": "Helmed in Melbourne by Michael Gibson and Robert Fletcher (veterans who previously spent decades leading Kay & Burton)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                8,
                11
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2217,
                "endIndex": 2474,
                "text": "Gibson alone has brokered some of the most expensive sales in Victorian history (such as the former Australian Government House *Stonnington Mansion* for $52 million and repeat sales of multi-tens-of-millions estates along Albany, Irving, and Lansell Roads)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                7,
                8
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2480,
                "endIndex": 2656,
                "text": "Affiliated with the international Forbes media and luxury real estate syndicate, giving listings direct access to global capital without relying purely on local listing portals"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                11,
                9
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2682,
                "endIndex": 2778,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Toorak, South Yarra, Boroondara, Bayside, Mornington Peninsula, Bellarine"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                12,
                13
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2782,
                "endIndex": 2863,
                "text": "**Reputation:** Melbourne’s oldest continuous prestige agency (founded in 1896)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2907,
                "endIndex": 3024,
                "text": "Over 130 years of history gives RT Edgar generational relationships with Melbourne’s established old-money families"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                13,
                14
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3030,
                "endIndex": 3231,
                "text": "Their Toorak office (frequently driven by top performers such as Sarah Case and Jeremy Fox) specializes in significant heritage mansions, subdivisions of landmark estates, and discreet private treaties"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                15,
                16,
                17
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3237,
                "endIndex": 3300,
                "text": "Highly experienced in quiet, high-value off-market negotiations"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                14
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3344,
                "endIndex": 3441,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Armadale, Toorak, South Yarra, and Victoria’s country/equestrian estates"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                18,
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3445,
                "endIndex": 3489,
                "text": "**Reputation:** The elite, discreet boutique"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                19,
                20
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3533,
                "endIndex": 3692,
                "text": "Deliberately avoids the \"high-volume franchise\" model in favor of a boutique, partner-led structure (steered by directors like Jock Langley and Andrew Harlock)"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                19,
                21
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3698,
                "endIndex": 3789,
                "text": "More than 80% of their transactions are referral-based or carried out completely off-market"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                19
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3795,
                "endIndex": 3965,
                "text": "If a vendor or buyer prioritizes total privacy away from public inspection queues, auction spectacle, and media scrutiny, Abercromby’s is often their first port of call"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                19,
                20
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4025,
                "endIndex": 4098,
                "text": "**Primary Footprint:** Stonnington, Bayside, and the Mornington Peninsula"
              },
              "groundingChunkIndices": [
                22,
                2,
                23
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4102,
                "endIndex": 4158,
                "text": "**Reputation:** The premier international luxury network"
